[00:24.28]1. Welcome to all who gather here this day
[00:32.08]To hear God’s Word and to learn his way.
[00:40.70]Life-giving truth he offers to us all;
[00:47.70]With thankfulness of heart, we respond to his call.
[01:06.14]2. Thanks to our God for brothers such as these,
[01:14.37]Who welcome us and who seek to please.
[01:22.60]May we keep holding men of that sort dear,
[01:29.60]And now we welcome others who meet with us here.
[01:43.52]3. God’s invitation reaches all mankind,
[01:57.44]That all sincere ones the truth may find.
[02:11.36]God by his Son has drawn us to His side.
[02:19.20]So welcome one another with hearts opened wide.